esting video on this topic  from over four months ago by Marshall D  preach and that video makes some great  points that I will talk about later on  at first I didn't pay too much attention  to this Theory just because Luffy  clearly wasn't born with white hair and  black wings so I thought there was no  way that he could turn out to be a  lunarian but as I was working on a  previous video about the original Joy  Boys secret Origins I realized that  Luffy might really possess a lunarian  DNA but not through his family tree or  bloodline Luffy possesses lunarian DNA  because the original Joy boy was a  lunarian and his lunarian DNA or lineage  Factor was passed on to Luffy through  the Nika devil fruit we know that all  life forms possess a lineage factor and  if you manipulate that lineage factor  from a young age the growth of the life  form can be altered we also know that  consuming a devil fruit actually Alters  a person's lineage factor and that is  what allows them to gain new Incredible  abilities that seem to violate the laws  of physics furthermore the lineage  factor of devil fruit users and even  animals can be used to create artificial  devil fruits as both Dr vegapunk and  Caesar Clown have done sanji's father  Vin smoke judge was even able to  manipulate the lineage factor of fetuses  in order to turn them into super  soldiers and he is also able to create  clone soldiers for germa 66. all of this  tells us that the lineage Factor plays a  major role in the one piece world and I  believe that there is one other  important role that it has been playing  all along but we just hadn't connected  the dots yet after Sabo consumes Aces  former devil fruit the metamera no me it  is implied that he inherited more than  just Ace's power there seems to be  something a of Aces still within the  fruit and Sabo has inherited that  something since his actions and  mannerisms seem to become more similar  to Aces after he eats the fruit we don't  know what exactly this something is and  a lot of people have just called it  Ace's will but what do we actually mean  by a will and how would a will reside  within a devil fruit it all starts to  make sense only when we remember the  lineage factor I believe that when  someone consumes a devil fruit it is not  just their lineage factor that is  altered by the devil fruit the lineage  factor of that devil fruit user also has  an effect on the devil fruit itself and  ultimately the user's own lineage Factor  becomes imprinted upon the devil fruit  so once the user dies and the devil  fruit is reincarnated some part of the  former user remains within the devil  fruit in the form of the former users  Lin lineage factor that is what happened  with Sauble when he consumed the  reincarnated merame he also consumed  some of Ace's lineage factors some of  his DNA and that is why his behavior  became more similar to Aces it's kind of  like that phenomenon in the real world  when organ transplant recipients begin  exhibiting some personality traits of  the organ's original owner now in my  video about joyboy's true Origins I  argued that the original Joy boy from  800 years ago was actually a lunarian I  also said that the ancient Kingdom which  fought against the alliance that became  the world government was the lunarian  homeland that sat Atop The Red Line  before marijua even existed the red line  was inhabited by a race of god-like  creatures known as the lunarians they  had large black wings which allow them  to fly they had the ability to generate  and manipulate fire and they had  superhuman physical resilience I believe  that the lunarians were ultimately  defeated during the void century and  their place as the gods who live Atop  The Red Line was usurped by the  celestial dragons they then proceeded to  build marijua on top of the ruins of the  ancient Kingdom's capital in an attempt  to erase the ancient Kingdom from  history the celestial dragons became the  new gods of the red line after driving  the former gods of the lunarians to the  brink of Extinction even today 800 years  after the Great War that took place  during the void Century the world  government still actively hunts  lunarians and they offer large cash  rewards for any information that would  lead to the capture of a lunarian this  seems like an oddly excessive policy by  the world government if the lunarians  are practically extinct and if they had  been forced off the red line 800 years  ago then why go to all that trouble just  to capture every lunarian sure lumerians  are powerful but so are the Giants and  many other races in one piece there has  to be some reason why the world  government feels especially threatened  by lunariates and why they are so  adamant on capturing them experimenting  on them and eventually eliminating them  as I mentioned earlier my hypothesis is  that the original Joy boy was a lunarian  who possessed the Nika devil fruit and  this is why the world government is so  obsessed with hunting down both the  lunarians and the Nika devil fruit they  may have believed that Joy boy would one  day return as another lunarian so along  with hunting the Nika devil fruit they  also decided to hunt down every lunarian  at the same time if there is one devil  fruit that the world government would  really love to recreate artificially it  is definitely the Nika devil fruit and  if the Nika fruit had originally  belonged to a lunarian then it makes  sense that king would be experimented on  inside the same research facility as  kaido whose own devil fruit was  artificially created by vegapunk in that  facility and speaking of King he is the  only lunarian whom we've actually met in  the story and of course he knew the  legend of joyboy he believed that joyboy  would one day return to change the world  if the original Joy boy had been a  lunarian then the legend of joyboy had  likely been passed down from generation  to generation among the remaining  lunarians and if this were the case then  King wouldn't even need to have any  knowledge of the poneoglyphs in order to  know about Joy boy he would have heard  the legend of Joy boy from his own  family when he was still a child now  back to the Nika devil fruit if my  theory is correct and the lineage factor  of former users can be imprinted on a  devil fruit and then passed on to the  next devil fruit user this would explain  so much about devil fruits in general  and about Luffy's abilities in  particular why do devil fruits appear to  have a will of their own because that  will comes from the the lineage factor  of former users why did Sabo inherit  some Oasis traits because he consumed  some of Ace's lineage Factor Why did  Luffy have Firebase powers like red hawk  and Red Rock even though his devil fruit  gave his body the properties of rubber  which has nothing to do with fire  because the original joyboy's lunarian  lineage Factor modified Luffy's body  when he consumed the Nika devil fruit  why does Luffy's hair turn white in gear  5. again because the original joyboy's  lineage Factor modified Luffy's body to  give him this lunarian trait even the  mystery of the ancient Kingdom's name  may have just been solved by this Theory  why is just the name of the ancient  Kingdom so dangerous that Clover was  killed before he could say it out loud  because that name was probably something  like lunaria or the redline Kingdom and  so just knowing that name would  instantly tell you that the celestial  dragons are usurpers frauds that the  true and rightful rulers of the red line  are not Celestial dragons but lumerians  and that marijua was likely built on top  of the ancient Kingdom's lumerian  capital in order to hide the truth about  who the original gods of the red line  are there is a lot more to be considered  here and as I said earlier in one of his  videos Marshall D preach went into great  detail about how Luffy's lunarian  connection was foreshadowed very early  on in the story preach points out that  Luffy's unusually high resistance to  fire was established as early as little  garden where we see that Luffy is able  to withstand being extremely close to a  massive fire while trying to rescue his  friends from Mr three's wax Luffy  doesn't even complain about the heat of  the fire that he was using to melt the  wax but Mr three who is right there  close to Luffy is screaming in pain  because of the fire and he Sprints away  from it as quickly as possible now Mr  three is literally a candle man who  produces Flames from his hair while  using his devil fruit Powers so you  would think that this guy's body would  be more resistant to fire than Luffy's  and yet that clearly doesn't seem to be  the case preach also mentions other  details like Luffy's quick recovery from  being frozen solid by aokiji and the  incident from chapter 1002 of the manga  in this chapter we see big mom hitting  Luffy with a lightning attack but it  doesn't affect him because he's made of  rubber I mean that part makes sense but  then right after that kaido hits Luffy  with blast breath and kaido is shocked  to see that his flame attack doesn't  seem to work on Luffy either we never  learned why exactly this was the case  but I think that we now finally know  what's actually going on here I will of  course link preach his video down in the  description so you can check it out it  goes into a lot of additional details  that I can't go into here the point  point is that all of these little  details finally begin to make perfect  sense if we accept that the original Joy  boy was lunarian that his lineage Factor  was somehow imprinted on the Nika devil  fruit and that Luffy then inherited some  of that lineage Factor when he consumed  the fruit as a child so along with the  properties of rubber that he gained from  the devil fruit itself Luffy also  inherited some of joyboy's lunarian  traits such as the ability to resist and  create fire such as the ability for his  hair to turn white in year 5 and so on  I've always felt that the introduction  of the lunarian race this late in the  story would have an important purpose  and I don't mean just in terms of  General World building but also in terms  of the plot itself if I am right that  the original Joy boy was a lunarian that  the ancient kingdom was the lunarian  kingdom Atop The Red Line and that Luffy  inherited lunarian traits through  joyboy's lineage Factor then everything  begins to add up and the the  introduction of the lunarian race at  this stage of the story suddenly isn't  just an interesting World building  detail it's an outright necessity for  the plot let me know what you guys think  does Luffy possess lunarian genetic  traits because of the original joyboy's  lineage Factor was the ancient Kingdom  actually the lunarian kingdom Atop The  Red Line was marijua built on the exact  location of the former lunarian capital  in order to erase this Kingdom's culture  and architecture from history don't  forget to leave your thoughts down in  the comments below I really love hearing  from you you guys know the drill if you  enjoy our videos and you want to see  more in the future just leave a like and  comment it only takes a second but it  really helps us with that YouTube  algorithm and of course if you're new  here or maybe you watch the channel but  you just haven't taken the time to  subscribe yet do me a favor and make  this the video that you subscribe and  hit that notification Bell to turn on  all notifications subscribing is a  completely free but really important way  of directly support supporting the  channel you can also hit me up on  Twitter and Instagram at anime uproar  thanks again to ninokuni crossworlds for  sponsoring this video check it out Link  in the description as always thank you  guys so much for watching and until next  time see ya Space Cowboys
 

